{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06627","headline":"朝邑蔡主簿期不会二首 一 · 储光羲","name":"朝邑蔡主簿期不会二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下位日趋走，久之宾会疎。\n空迟偶词赋，所媿比园庐。\n朝念池上酌，暮逢林下书。\n方将固封守，暂欲混畋渔。\n衰柳隐长路，秋云满太虚。\n遥遥望左右，日入未回车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06627.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06627","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}